1000                  (../MS Extended BA):00193         RESVEC:
1000 10CE41DC         (../MS Extended BA):00194         LA00E     LDS  #LINBUF+LBUFMX+1 SET STACK TO TOP OF LINE INPUT BUFFER
1004 113D01           (../MS Extended BA):00195                   LDMD #$01           ; switch to 6309 native mode
1007 8640             (../MS Extended BA):00196                   LDA  #$40           ; BASIC state variables live on direct page $40
1009 1F8B             (../MS Extended BA):00197                   TFR  A,DP
                      (../MS Extended BA):00198                   ; JSR  UART_INIT      ;initialize SERIAL PORT  (already done by bios)
100B 966E             (../MS Extended BA):00199                   LDA  RSTFLG         GET WARM START FLAG 
100D 8155             (../MS Extended BA):00200                   CMPA #$55           IS IT A WARM START? 
