                      (../MS Extended BA):00795         ; SEARCH THE STACK FOR ‘GOSUB/RETURN’ OR ‘FOR/NEXT’ DATA.                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):00796         ; THE ‘FOR/NEXT’ INDEX VARIABLE DESCRIPTOR ADDRESS BEING                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):00797         ; SOUGHT IS STORED IN VARDES. EACH BLOCK OF FOR/NEXT DATA IS 18                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):00798         ; BYTES WITH A $80 LEADER BYTE AND THE GOSUB/RETURN DATA IS 5 BYTES                      
