                      (../MS Extended BA):00987         ;         8=STEP DIRECTION: $FF IF NEGATIVE; 0 IF ZERO; 1 IF POSITIVE;  
                      (../MS Extended BA):00988         ; 9-13=FP VALUE OF ‘TO’ PARAMETER;                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):00989         ; 14,15=CURRENT LINE NUMBER; 16,17=RAM ADDRESS OF THE END                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):00990         ;         OF   THE LINE CONTAINING THE ‘FOR’ STATEMENT  
