                      (../MS Extended BA):03609         ; EXPRESSION. ENTER WITH (X) POINTING TO A TABLE                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):03610         ; OF COEFFICIENTS, THE FIRST BYTE OF WHICH IS THE                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):03611         ; NUMBER OF (COEFFICIENTS-1) FOLLOWED BY THAT NUMBER                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):03612         ; OF PACKED FLOATING POINT NUMBERS. THE                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):03613         ; POLYNOMIAL IS EVALUATED AS FOLLOWS: VALUE =                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):03614         ; (((FPA0*Y0+Y1)*FPA0+Y2)*FPA0…YN)                      
2663 9F64             (../MS Extended BA):03615         LBEFF     STX  COEFPT         SAVE COEFFICIENT TABLE POINTER 
2665 BD238E           (../MS Extended BA):03616         LBF01     JSR  LBC2A          MOVE FPA0 TO FPA4 
