266A E680             (../MS Extended BA):03618                   LDB  ,X+            GET THE TOP OF COEFFICIENT TABLE TO 
266C D755             (../MS Extended BA):03619                   STB  COEFCT         * USE AND STORE IT IN TEMPORARY COUNTER 
266E 9F64             (../MS Extended BA):03620                   STX  COEFPT         SAVE NEW COEFFICIENT POINTER 
2670 8DEE             (../MS Extended BA):03621         LBF0C     BSR  LBEFC          MULTIPLY (X) BY FPA0 
