                      (../MS Extended BA):03753         ; ATN                          
                      (../MS Extended BA):03754         ; A 12 TERM TAYLOR SERIES IS USED TO EVALUATE THE                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):03755         ; ARCTAN EXPRESSION. TWO  DIFFERENT FORMULI ARE USED  
                      (../MS Extended BA):03756         ; TO EVALUATE THE EXPRESSION DEPENDING UPON                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):03757         ; WHETHER OR NOT THE ARGUMENT SQUARED IS > OR < 1.0                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):03758                                        
                      (../MS Extended BA):03759         ; IF X**2<1 THEN ATN=X-(X**3)/3+(X**5)/5-(X**7)/7. . .                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):03760         ; IF X**2>=1 THEN ATN=PI/2-(1/X-1/((X**3)*3)+(1/((X**5)*5)-. . .)                      
                      (../MS Extended BA):03761                                        
2788 9654             (../MS Extended BA):03762         ATN       LDA  FP0SGN         * GET THE SIGN OF THE MANTISSA AND 
278A 3402             (../MS Extended BA):03763                   PSHS A              * SAVE IT ON THE STACK 
278C 2A02             (../MS Extended BA):03764                   BPL  L83B8          BRANCH IF POSITIVE MANTISSA 
278E 8D24             (../MS Extended BA):03765                   BSR  L83DC          CHANGE SIGN OF FPA0 
2790 964F             (../MS Extended BA):03766         L83B8     LDA  FP0EXP         * GET EXPONENT OF FPA0 AND 
2792 3402             (../MS Extended BA):03767                   PSHS A              * SAVE IT ON THE STACK 
2794 8181             (../MS Extended BA):03768                   CMPA #$81           IS FPAO < 1.0? 
2796 2505             (../MS Extended BA):03769                   BLO  L83C5          YES 
2798 8E2229           (../MS Extended BA):03770                   LDX  #LBAC5         POINT X TO FP CONSTANT 1.0 
279B 8DDE             (../MS Extended BA):03771                   BSR  L83A3          GET RECIPROCAL OF FPA0 
279D 8E27B8           (../MS Extended BA):03772         L83C5     LDX  #L83E0         POINT (X) TO TAYLOR SERIES COEFFICIENTS 
27A0 BD2654           (../MS Extended BA):03773                   JSR  LBEF0          EXPAND POLYNOMIAL 
27A3 3502             (../MS Extended BA):03774                   PULS A              GET EXPONENT OF ARGUMENT 
27A5 8181             (../MS Extended BA):03775                   CMPA #$81           WAS ARGUMENT < 1.0? 
27A7 2506             (../MS Extended BA):03776                   BLO  L83D7          YES 
27A9 8E2783           (../MS Extended BA):03777                   LDX  #L83AB         POINT (X) TO FP NUMBER (PI/2) 
27AC BD211D           (../MS Extended BA):03778                   JSR  LB9B9          SUBTRACT FPA0 FROM (PI/2) 
27AF 3502             (../MS Extended BA):03779         L83D7     PULS A              * GET SIGN OF INITIAL ARGUMENT MANTISSA 
27B1 4D               (../MS Extended BA):03780                   TSTA                * AND SET FLAGS ACCORDING TO IT 
